{"id":396,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"DEEP学習で探究を深める附属中","feature_description":"横浜サイエンスフロンティア高等学校附属中学校は、学校紹介、教育方針、特色ある教育課程をホームページで示し、DEEP学習、サイエンススタディーズ、フロンティアタイム、YSFJH基本計画を軸に学びを組み立てています。探究と科学的な視点を重ね、主体的に考える力を育てる構成です。学校生活全体を支える情報も公開され、学びの流れを追いやすいです。","clubs":[],"profile_sources":[{"id":3188,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.jp/school/jhs/hs-sf/index.cfm?sitemap=1%2C0%2C2%2Chtml","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-07","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3189,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.jp/school/jhs/hs-sf/index.cfm?sitemap=1%2C0%2C2%2Chtml","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-07","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
